WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:04.000
Get down!

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:06.280
I am Azania Maqoma.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:08.400
Commander of the Numoor.

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:16.640
We live in the shadows.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:18.640
-But today…
-Let's go!

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:20.400
…we come into the light.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:21.320
We're ready.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:25.480
Your justice
belongs to the privileged elite.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:27.440
But we're going to change that.

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:30.720
And you will see who he truly is.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.360
I was ordered to do it.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.440
You are the one who killed them!

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:38.240
You will choose.

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:40.760
Freedom

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:42.720
or death.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:44.600
I'm innocent!

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:46.520
I'm innocent!

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:47.600
I'm a hero!

